Package: C2PROCTTEST
Title: SAS PROC TTEST Equivalent in R
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Your", "Name", email = "your@email.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Replicates the output of SAS PROC TTEST in R for one-sample,
    two independent samples, and paired samples t-tests. Produces console
    tables matching SAS formatting including Statistics, Confidence Limits,
    T-Tests, and Equality of Variances (Folded F) tables. Also produces
    SAS-style diagnostic plots for each test type.
